One library package whose published surface is a closed world, carrying a directive
over a declaration the narrowing kind reports. The class of an exported declaration of
a library the run loaded no consumer of is possible, so a run that raises the minimum
confidence above it withholds the finding the configuration already withholds, which
is what makes the record dormant rather than in effect.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/lib

go 1.27.1
-- lib.go --
package lib

//deadset:ignore DS1101 -- exported for a reader of this package alone
func Narrowed() int { return 3 }

// Entry is the published surface, and its body holds the only reference to Narrowed.
func Entry() int { return Narrowed() }
